# ==========================================
# KEEP REQUIRED ASSIGNMENT RESULTS
# Do not ignore:
# - Task 1 final LoRA adapter and train_summary.json
# - Task 2 PDFs, questions.json and retrieval metrics
# - Task 3 benchmark and concurrency results
# - report/my_answers.md
# - report/report.pdf
# - README.md
